    "title": "📅 Stagecoach Citizens Advisory Board Meets April 1 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago The Stagecoach Citizens Advisory Board will meet on Wednesday, April 1, 2026, at 7:00 PM at the Stagecoach Community Center (8204 W Hwy 50) . The agenda includes a presentation from Lyon County Community Development about a temporary use permit for an NV Energy laydown yard , discussion of a proposed Stagecoach Safety Day in June, and updates from local agencies including the Sheriff’s Office and Fire District.\nResidents can share input during public comment or by emailing sccab@lyon-county.org (subject line: PUBLIC COMMENT) by March 31 . The meeting is open to the public.\nMore Info: https://www.lyon-county.org/AgendaCenter/ViewFile/...",
    "summary": "5 hours ago The Stagecoach Citizens Advisory Board will meet on Wednesday, April 1, 2026, at 7:00 PM at the Stagecoach Community Center (8204 W Hwy 50) . The agenda includes a presentation from Lyon County Community Development about a temporary use permit for an NV Energy laydown yard , discussion of a proposed Stagecoach Safety Day in June, and updates from local agencies including the Sheriff’s Office and Fire District. Residents can share input during public comment or by emailing sccab@lyon-county.org (subject line: PUBLIC COMMENT) by March 31 . The meeting is open to the public.",
